.</p><section><h2>Cheikh al-Islam Ibn Taymiyya</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فمثل هذا قد يجوز أن يراد به كل المعاني التي قالها السلف<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 13/341</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=fr#s89a3\">Ouvrir dans le tafsir interactif (textes complets)</a><div class=\"pn\"><span></span><a href=\"/fr/ayah/89-5.html\">Verset suivant (89:5)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir des deux Cheikhs · <a href=\"/fr/\">Accueil</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">À propos du projet</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Confidentialité et conditions</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/89-5.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"fr\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir de Al-Fajr 89:5 — selon Ibn Taymiyya et Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"5. N’y a-t-il pas là un serment pour un esprit sagace?\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/89-5.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/89-5.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/89-5.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/89-5.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/89-5.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/89-5.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/89-5.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/89-5.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/89-5.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://t